 Test Drive booking flow |\n30: | *[Teammate 2]* | *[Roll No]* | *[3 Assigned Pages]* | *[Features Built]* |\n31: | *[Teammate 3]* | *[Roll No]* | *[3 Assigned Pages]* | *[Features Built]* |\n32: | *[Teammate 4]* | *[Roll No]* | *[3 Assigned Pages]* | *[Features Built]* |\n33: | *[Teammate 5]* | *[Roll No]* | *[3 Assigned Pages]* | *[Features Built]* |\n34: \n35: ## Project Structure\n36: - `index.html` — Home Page\n37: - `pages/explore-cars.html` — Explore Cars Page\n38: - `pages/car-details.html` — Car Details Page\n39: - `css/common.css` & `css/pages.css` — Shared theme (`#111827`, `#D9A441`, `#FFFFFF`, `#F3F4F6`) and responsive layouts\n40: - `js/cars-data.js` — Shared JavaScript dataset of new vehicles\n41: - `js/common.js` — Shared navbar, footer, `localStorage` wishlist, and 4-state Test Drive booking flow\n42: - `js/home.js`, `js/explore.js`, `js/car-details.js` — Page-specific scripts\n43: - `images/` — Website logo, hero banner, and vehicle images (AI image generation disclosed in site footer)\n44: - `docs/` — Prototype photos, feedback photos, testing/documentation notes, and exported Antigravity CLI logs"}
