{"step_index":22,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T12:55:42Z","model":"gemini-4-hydrogen-high","input_tokens":4830,"cache_read_tokens":48017,"output_tokens":2748,"thinking":"Visual inspection reveals an obsidian dark and charcoal black surface theme across the interface elements. Initial assumption of a standard neutral-grey palette is incorrect; surface backgrounds distinctly feature deep charcoal tones.\n\nColor values converge around `#121212` to `#161616` for backgrounds, paired with a warm gold and amber yellow accent palette (`#eab308` range) for interactive elements and brand accents. Typography relies on high-contrast white weights for primary headings balanced against muted warm greys for secondary text.\n\nExisting shield-and-car logo asset requires replacement to match the new `CAR ✦ VAULT` branding featuring a 4-pointed gold star separator. Header implementation needs an accompanying top announcement bar displaying centered uppercase location text above the navigation links.\n\nNavigation items require precise alignment with the visual specification, incorporating distinct links for saved vehicles, admin access, and interactive test drive triggers. Desktop layout demands careful horizontal spacing and flexible wrapping rules to prevent text crowding across standard viewport widths.\n\nSection typography requires small gold uppercase eyebrows styled with tight tracking, paired with heavy white display titles and muted grey subtitles. Card components demand dark charcoal surfaces edged in faint translucent borders that brighten to gold upon hover states.\n\nFooter structural layout maps out four distinct columns spanning collections, services, and corporate links, utilizing matching internal file paths. Initial impulse was to hardcode external references, but adopting the established repository convention for relative page targets ensures consistency across navigation triggers.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":150,"Path":"C:\\Users\\User\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\CarVault project\\docs\\documentation.md","StartLine":1}},{"name":"read_file","args":{"EndLine":150,"Path":"C:\\Users\\User\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\CarVault project\\docs\\feedback-log.md","StartLine":1}}]}
{"step_index":23,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T12:55:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nShowing lines 1-26 of 26\n1: # CAR VAULT — Code Explanation & Documentation (Hamza Taqvim, 26I-3054)\n2: \n3: This guide explains how your 3 pages work in simple English so you can confidently present the project and answer viva questions.\n4: \n5: ## 1. File Organization\n6: - **`index.html` (Home Page):** Shows the `CAR VAULT` header, *\"Find Your Perfect Car\"* heading, hero image, 4 stat boxes (`80+ Vehicles`, `06 Luxury Brands`, `100% Passion`, `24/7 Support`), **Explore Cars** button, **Featured Cars** (`BMW M5`, `Mercedes C400`), **Popular Brands** links, and footer.\n7: - **`pages/explore-cars.html` (Explore Cars Page):** Shows the *\"Explore Our Cars\"* heading, search bar, sort dropdown, left **FILTERS** sidebar (Brand, Price, Type + **Apply** / **Reset** buttons), and responsive car grid.\n8: - **`pages/car-details.html` (Car Details Page):** Shows breadcrumbs (`Home / Explore Cars / [Car Name]`), main photo + 3 clickable thumbnails, car specs (`Brand New · 2026`, Price, Engine, Fuel, Transmission, Type), **BOOK** button, **Wishlist** button, Description, and Monthly Installment Estimator.\n9: \n10: ## 2. How the CSS Works\n11: - **`css/common.css`:** Defines CSS variables in `:root` for the theme (`--navy: #111827`, `--gold: #d9a441`, `--white: #ffffff`, `--light-grey: #f3f4f6`), shared buttons, navbar, car cards, footer, and modal dialogs.\n12: - **`css/pages.css`:** Styles page-specific layouts (like the 2-column Featured grid, Explore sidebar + grid, Details split view) and uses `@media` queries for mobile responsiveness.\n13: \n14: ## 3. How the JavaScript Connects Everything\n15: 1. **`js/cars-data.js`:** Holds `CAR_VAULT_CARS`, an array of 10 brand-new 2026 car objects. Each object stores `id`, `brand`, `model`, `price` (numeric PKR), `priceLabel`, `type`, `engine`, `fuel`, `transmission`, `image`, `gallery`, and `description`.\n16: 2. **`js/common.js`:**\n17:    - Injects the shared navbar and footer using `PATH_PREFIX` (`\"\"` on root, `\"../\"` inside `pages/`).\n18:    - Manages the **Wishlist** using `localStorage.getItem(\"carvault_wishlist\")` and `localStorage.setItem(...)` so saved cars stay saved after refreshing or switching pages.\n19:    - Runs the **4-State Test Drive Booking Flow** inside a modal:\n20:      - **State 1 (Empty Form):** Opens with empty inputs and the chosen car selected.\n21:      - **State 2 (Filled Form):** Saves user input on submit (`currentBookingDraft`).\n22:      - **State 3 (Success):** If name, date, time, 10–13 digit phone, and valid email pass, saves a demo record to `localStorage` and shows `\"Booking Confirmed! Your test drive booking request has been submitted.\"` with a **Back to Car** button.\n23:      - **State 4 (Failed Validation):** If phone or email is invalid, shows `\"Incorrect phone number or email. Please enter again.\"` with a **Try Again** button that restores State 2 with the user's input preserved.\n24: 3. **`js/home.js`:** Filters `CAR_VAULT_CARS` for `car.featured === true` and renders the 2 featured cards, plus links each Popular Brand to `pages/explore-cars.html?brand=...`.\n25: 4. **`js/explore.js`:** Reads `?brand=` or `?search=` from `window.location.search`, filters `CAR_VAULT_CARS` by search text, selected brand checkboxes, PKR price brackets (`10-50`, `50-100`, `100-plus`), and body type checkboxes, then sorts and updates the grid and result count.\n26: 5. **`js/car-details.js`:** Reads `?id=` from the URL, calls `getCarById(carId)`, populates the specs, switches the main image when gallery thumbnails are clicked, syncs the Wishlist button, and calculates estimated monthly installments (`financedAmount / months`)."}
{"step_index":24,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T12:55:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-27T17:55:56+05:00\nShowing lines 1-16 of 16\n1: # CAR VAULT — User Feedback & Change Log Notes (Hamza Taqvim, 26I-3054)\n2: \n3: Use this file to track feedback collected from your Google Form sessions and record what you changed on the website (to include in `docs/Prototype_and_Feedback_Report.pdf`).\n4: \n5: ## Feedback Session Checklist (CL1000 Requirements)\n6: - [ ] At least **2 feedback sessions** conducted on your 3 pages\n7: - [ ] At least **1 photo per session** showing Hamza Taqvim, the participant, and the physical prototype chart saved in `docs/feedback-photos/` (named `26i-3054_session1.jpg`, `26i-3054_session2.jpg`)\n8: - [ ] Photos of Hamza visible with horizontal & vertical prototype charts saved in `docs/prototype-photos/`\n9: - [ ] Google Form responses collected (Consent question + Task completion + 1–5 ratings + Open feedback)\n10: \n11: ## Change Table Template\n12: \n13: | Feedback Received | Page | Member | Decision | Reason | Change Made on Website |\n14: | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n15: | *[Add feedback 1 from Google Form]* | Explore Cars | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) | Change / Keep | *[Reason]* | *[Change made]* |\n16: | *[Add feedback 2 from Google Form]* | Car Details | Hamza Taqvim (26I-3054) | Change / Keep | *[Reason]* | *[Change made]* |"}
{"step_index":25,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-27T12:55:56Z","model":"gemini-4-hydrogen-high","input_tokens":4643,"cache_read_tokens":52557,"output_tokens":15590,"thinking":"Target specifications require updating the visual identity while preserving all existing DOM selectors and script bindings across pages. Component logic and persistent storage handlers must remain untouched to prevent regressions in filtering, booking flows, and state management.\n\nTarget branding requires replacing existing assets with a stylized typographic wordmark incorporating an inline gold four-pointed star. Top utility bars demand specific Islamabad-focused typography and dark-themed styling across all pages without disrupting established element selectors.\n\nNavbar layout requires specific spacing constraints, utilizing subtle borders and precise typography scaling. Initial desktop sizing risks item collisions below twelve-forty pixels, necessitating responsive fallback handling or compact horizontal spacing to prevent awkward wrapping.\n\nCalculated dimensional layout limits indicate twelve navigation links, the logo, and the call-to-action button fit within a custom container width constraint at standard desktop resolutions without wrapping. Footer styling requires a dark charcoal aesthetic structured in a four-column grid featuring specific brand taxonomy, descriptive typography, and direct modal integration for service actions.\n\nTarget mapping requires routing footer links to existing page structures like the FAQ and admin portals while preserving specific modal triggers. Bottom bar layout demands replicating the precise typographic branding and subtle separator rules shown in the reference design.\n\nBottom bar copy requires matching the exact legal and stylistic text from the reference design. Establishing precise dark luxury theme CSS variables ensures consistent surface colors, matte black backgrounds, and crisp gold accents across all pages.\n\nEstablishing geometric display typography variants with tight letter-spacing achieves the required ultra-crisp automotive showroom aesthetic. Eyebrow headers and secondary subtitles structured above primary headings across core pages align with the established dark luxury visual hierarchy.\n\nSearch inputs, sort dropdowns, and filter sidebars require cohesive dark charcoal treatments paired with gold accent elements and precise borders. Modal components demand matching surface styling, custom input fields, and distinct focus states to maintain visual harmony. Inline pricing styles within persistent wishlist scripts need refactoring into dedicated utility classes to prevent readability failures under dark color schemes.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 260 56\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CAR VAULT logo\">\n  <rect width=\"260\" height=\"56\" rx=\"8\" fill=\"#141414\"/>\n  <text x=\"20\" y=\"36\" fill=\"#F5F5F5\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, DM Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\"4\">CAR</text>\n  <path d=\"M114 14 L117.6 24.4 L128 28 L117.6 31.6 L114 42 L110.4 31.6 L100 28 L110.4 24.4 Z\" fill=\"#EAB308\"/>\n  <text x=\"142\" y=\"36\" fill=\"#F5F5F5\" font-family=\"Plus Jakarta Sans, DM Sans, Arial, sans-serif\" font-size=\"22\" font-weight=\"800\" letter-spacing=\"4\">VAULT</text>\n</svg>\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\User\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\CarVault project\\images\\logo\\car-vault-logo.svg"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CAR VAULT — Shared Obsidian Luxury Theme & Layout Styles (css/common.css)\n   Theme Colors: Charcoal (#141414), Elevated Surface (#1B1B1B),\n   Gold Accent (#EAB308), Crisp White (#F5F5F5), Muted Grey (#A1A1AA)\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n:root {\n  /* Core Dark Luxury Palette */\n  --bg-page: #141414;\n  --bg-header: #121212;\n  --bg-surface: #1b1b1b;\n  --bg-surface-2: #222222;\n  --bg-input: #121212;\n\n  /* Compatibility & Accent Tokens */\n  --navy: #141414;\n  --navy-dark: #0d0d0d;\n  --navy-light: #242424;\n  --gold: #eab308;\n  --gold-hover: #facc15;\n  --gold-deep: #ca8a04;\n  --gold-soft: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.14);\n\n  --white: #f5f5f5;\n  --pure-white: #ffffff;\n  --light-grey: #1b1b1b;\n  --border-grey: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\n  --border-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n\n  --text-dark: #f5f5f5;\n  --text-secondary: #d4d4d8;\n  --text-muted: #9ca3af;\n\n  /* Feedback States (Dark-Mode Tuned) */\n  --success-bg: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.12);\n  --success-border: #10b981;\n  --success-text: #6ee7b7;\n  --error-bg: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.12);\n  --error-border: #ef4444;\n  --error-text: #fca5a5;\n\n  --shadow-sm: 0 4px 16px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.32);\n  --shadow-md: 0 18px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);\n  --radius-sm: 6px;\n  --radius-md: 10px;\n  --radius-pill: 999px;\n}\n\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nhtml {\n  scroll-behavior: smooth;\n  color-scheme: dark;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: \"Plus Jakarta Sans\", \"DM Sans\", \"Segoe UI\", Arial, sans-serif;\n  background: radial-gradient(circle at 25% 0%, #1e1e1e 0%, #141414 48%, #101010 100%);\n  background-color: var(--bg-page);\n  color: var(--text-dark);\n  line-height: 1.6;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\nmain {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\nimg {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n}\n\na {\n  color: inherit;\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\nbutton,\ninput,\nselect {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n}\n\n/* Visible focus state for keyboard accessibility */\na:focus-visible,\nbutton:focus-visible,\ninput:focus-visible,\nselect:focus-visible {\n  outline: 2px solid var(--gold);\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\n.container {\n  width: min(1240px, calc(100% - 36px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Luxury Section Eyebrow & Typography Helpers ---------- */\n.section-eyebrow {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Buttons ---------- */\n.btn {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n  border: 1px solid transparent;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.2s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.btn:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n}\n\n.btn-primary {\n  background-color: var(--gold);\n  color: #111111;\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.btn-primary:hover {\n  background-color: var(--gold-hover);\n  border-color: var(--gold-hover);\n  box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.25);\n}\n\n.btn-navy {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface-2);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  border-color: var(--border-strong);\n}\n\n.btn-navy:hover {\n  background-color: #2c2c2c;\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.btn-outline {\n  background-color: transparent;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  border-color: var(--border-strong);\n}\n\n.btn-outline:hover {\n  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.btn-outline.is-active {\n  background-color: var(--gold-soft);\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n/* ---------- Top Announcement Bar & Header / Navbar ---------- */\n.site-header {\n  background-color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 0.96);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(12px);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  position: sticky;\n  top: 0;\n  z-index: 100;\n}\n\n.top-utility-bar {\n  background-color: #0e0e0e;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  padding: 7px 16px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 0.68rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #d4d4d8;\n}\n\n.navbar {\n  width: min(1360px, calc(100% - 32px));\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 16px;\n  min-height: 66px;\n}\n\n/* Brand Logo: CAR ✦ VAULT */\n.brand-logo {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  font-size: 1.08rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.brand-star {\n  width: 14px;\n  height: 14px;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.nav-links {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 15px;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.nav-links a,\n.nav-links button.nav-action-link {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  color: #d4d4d8;\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 6px 2px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  transition: color 0.2s ease;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 4px;\n}\n\n.nav-links a:hover,\n.nav-links a.active,\n.nav-links button.nav-action-link:hover {\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.nav-links a.active {\n  color: var(--gold);\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.nav-links a.active::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: -2px;\n  height: 2px;\n  background-color: var(--gold);\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n.nav-heart-icon {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  line-height: 1;\n}\n\n.saved-badge {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background-color: var(--gold);\n  color: #111111;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  min-width: 17px;\n  height: 17px;\n  padding: 0 4px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n}\n\n.nav-right-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.nav-cta-btn {\n  background-color: var(--gold);\n  color: #111111;\n  border: 1px solid var(--gold);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 9px 14px;\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  transition: background-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.nav-cta-btn:hover {\n  background-color: var(--gold-hover);\n  transform: translateY(-1px);\n  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.28);\n}\n\n.mobile-controls {\n  display: none;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.menu-toggle {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface-2);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 6px 11px;\n  font-size: 1.05rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.menu-toggle:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n/* ---------- Shared Car Card ---------- */\n.car-card {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n  transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n}\n\n.car-card:hover {\n  transform: translateY(-4px);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  border-color: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.65);\n}\n\n.car-card-link {\n  display: block;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.car-card-image-wrap {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 220px;\n  background-color: #101010;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n}\n\n.car-card-image-wrap img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  transition: transform 0.35s ease;\n}\n\n.car-card:hover .car-card-image-wrap img {\n  transform: scale(1.03);\n}\n\n.car-badge {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 12px;\n  left: 12px;\n  background-color: rgba(17, 17, 17, 0.88);\n  color: var(--gold);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.55);\n  padding: 4px 10px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n}\n\n.car-card-body {\n  padding: 18px 20px;\n}\n\n.car-card-meta {\n  font-size: 0.74rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-bottom: 5px;\n}\n\n.car-card-title {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n}\n\n.car-card-price {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.car-card-footer {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 12px 20px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  background-color: #161616;\n}\n\n.card-details-cta {\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n  transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.card-details-cta:hover {\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.icon-wish-btn {\n  background: var(--bg-surface-2);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n  padding: 5px 12px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 5px;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.icon-wish-btn:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.icon-wish-btn.saved {\n  background-color: var(--gold-soft);\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n/* ---------- Footer (Matches Screenshot Layout) ---------- */\n.site-footer {\n  background-color: #111111;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  padding: 56px 0 28px;\n  margin-top: 64px;\n}\n\n.footer-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 36px;\n  margin-bottom: 44px;\n}\n\n.footer-brand-col .brand-logo {\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.footer-brand-desc {\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: #9ca3af;\n  max-width: 320px;\n  line-height: 1.65;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.footer-tagline {\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.footer-col h4 {\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  font-size: 0.92rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.footer-col ul {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 11px;\n}\n\n.footer-col a,\n.footer-link-btn {\n  background: none;\n  border: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  font: inherit;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: #a1a1aa;\n  text-align: left;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.footer-col a:hover,\n.footer-link-btn:hover {\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.footer-bottom {\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  padding-top: 22px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: #9ca3af;\n}\n\n.footer-craft-tag {\n  font-size: 0.72rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #9ca3af;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Modals (4-State Test Drive Booking & Wishlist) ---------- */\n.modal-backdrop {\n  position: fixed;\n  inset: 0;\n  background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.78);\n  backdrop-filter: blur(4px);\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  padding: 16px;\n  z-index: 200;\n}\n\n.modal-backdrop.hidden {\n  display: none;\n}\n\n.modal-box {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 520px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  border-top: 4px solid var(--gold);\n  padding: 26px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  max-height: 90vh;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n  position: relative;\n}\n\n.modal-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n}\n\n.modal-header h2 {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n}\n\n.modal-close {\n  background: var(--bg-surface-2);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  width: 34px;\n  height: 34px;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.modal-close:hover {\n  background-color: var(--gold);\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  color: #111111;\n}\n\n.form-group {\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.form-group label {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.form-group input,\n.form-group select {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background-color: var(--bg-input);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n}\n\n.form-group input:focus,\n.form-group select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.form-row-2 {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.demo-note {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  background-color: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n/* Booking States 3 & 4 */\n.state-box {\n  padding: 22px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.state-box.success {\n  background-color: var(--success-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--success-border);\n  color: var(--success-text);\n}\n\n.state-box.failed {\n  background-color: var(--error-bg);\n  border: 1px solid var(--error-border);\n  color: var(--error-text);\n}\n\n.state-box h3 {\n  font-size: 1.2rem;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.state-details {\n  background-color: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 12px;\n  margin: 14px 0;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  text-align: left;\n  font-size: 0.92rem;\n}\n\n/* Wishlist Modal Items */\n.wishlist-list {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.wishlist-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 12px;\n  padding: 10px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background-color: var(--bg-input);\n}\n\n.wishlist-item-info {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.wishlist-item-info img {\n  width: 68px;\n  height: 48px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  border-radius: 6px;\n}\n\n.wishlist-item-price {\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.wishlist-actions {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n/* Toast Notification */\n.toast {\n  position: fixed;\n  right: 20px;\n  bottom: 20px;\n  background-color: #181818;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  border: 1px solid var(--gold);\n  padding: 12px 18px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  z-index: 300;\n}\n\n/* ---------- Responsive Navbar & Footer ---------- */\n@media (max-width: 1180px) {\n  .mobile-controls {\n    display: flex;\n  }\n\n  .nav-right-actions {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .nav-links {\n    display: none;\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 100%;\n    left: 0;\n    right: 0;\n    background-color: #141414;\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    padding: 16px 24px 20px;\n    gap: 12px;\n    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  }\n\n  .nav-links.open {\n    display: flex;\n  }\n\n  .nav-links-mobile-cta {\n    width: 100%;\n    margin-top: 6px;\n  }\n\n  .nav-links-mobile-cta .nav-cta-btn {\n    width: 100%;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 11px 16px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (min-width: 1181px) {\n  .nav-links-mobile-cta {\n    display: none;\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .top-utility-bar {\n    font-size: 0.6rem;\n    letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n    padding: 6px 12px;\n  }\n\n  .footer-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    gap: 28px;\n  }\n\n  .form-row-2 {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\User\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\CarVault project\\css\\common.css"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"/* ==========================================================================\n   CAR VAULT — Page-Specific Styles (css/pages.css)\n   Covers: Home Page, Explore Cars Page, and Car Details Page\n   Matches the Dark Obsidian & Warm Gold luxury showroom theme.\n   ========================================================================== */\n\n/* ---------- 1. HOME PAGE ---------- */\n.home-hero {\n  padding: 44px 0 36px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n}\n\n.hero-header-block {\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.home-hero-title {\n  font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4.4vw, 3.25rem);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.hero-subtitle {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.98rem;\n  max-width: 560px;\n}\n\n.hero-banner-box {\n  position: relative;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);\n  background-color: #0e0e0e;\n}\n\n.hero-banner-img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 410px;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.hero-stats-row {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n  gap: 14px;\n  margin: 22px auto 24px;\n  max-width: 820px;\n}\n\n.stat-box {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 16px 12px;\n  text-align: center;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.stat-box:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n.stat-box strong {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  font-weight: 800;\n}\n\n.stat-box span {\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.home-explore-cta-wrap {\n  margin-top: 10px;\n}\n\n.home-explore-cta {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 15px 24px;\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.home-section {\n  padding: 46px 0 28px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n}\n\n.home-section:last-of-type {\n  border-bottom: none;\n  padding-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.section-header-split {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  gap: 24px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.section-header-aside {\n  max-width: 400px;\n  text-align: right;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  line-height: 1.5;\n}\n\n.section-title {\n  font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 2.8vw, 2.15rem);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  letter-spacing: -0.025em;\n  line-height: 1.15;\n}\n\n.featured-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 24px;\n}\n\n/* Popular Brands strip (cleanly links straight into Explore filters) */\n.brands-strip {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);\n  gap: 14px;\n}\n\n.brand-pill-card {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  padding: 18px 12px;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.92rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.03em;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  transition: all 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.brand-pill-card:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface-2);\n  color: var(--gold);\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\n}\n\n/* ---------- 2. EXPLORE CARS PAGE ---------- */\n.explore-header {\n  padding: 40px 0 24px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  margin-bottom: 28px;\n}\n\n.explore-header h1 {\n  font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.6vw, 2.85rem);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.explore-subtitle {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-size: 0.96rem;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.search-sort-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.search-input-wrap {\n  position: relative;\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.search-icon {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 16px;\n  top: 50%;\n  transform: translateY(-50%);\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.search-input {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 13px 18px 13px 44px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  font-weight: 500;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.search-input::placeholder {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.search-input:focus {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n  outline: none;\n}\n\n.sort-select {\n  width: 220px;\n  padding: 13px 14px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.mobile-filter-toggle {\n  display: none;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.explore-layout {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 270px 1fr;\n  gap: 26px;\n  align-items: start;\n  padding-bottom: 24px;\n}\n\n.filters-sidebar {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-top: 3px solid var(--gold);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 20px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.filters-title {\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  padding-bottom: 10px;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n}\n\n.filter-group {\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.filter-group h3 {\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.filter-option {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 9px;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.filter-option:hover {\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n}\n\n.filter-option input {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  accent-color: var(--gold);\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.filter-actions {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 8px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.results-toolbar {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  align-items: center;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.explore-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 20px;\n}\n\n.empty-state {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  border: 1px dashed var(--border-strong);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 48px 20px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.empty-state h3 {\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.empty-state p {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n/* ---------- 3. CAR DETAILS PAGE ---------- */\n.breadcrumb {\n  padding: 22px 0 14px;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 8px;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\n.breadcrumb a {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.breadcrumb a:hover {\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.details-card-shell {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  padding: 28px;\n  box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);\n}\n\n.details-split {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 1fr;\n  gap: 32px;\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.gallery-main {\n  border-radius: var(--radius-md);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  background-color: #101010;\n  height: 360px;\n}\n\n.gallery-main img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.gallery-thumbs {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-top: 12px;\n}\n\n.thumb-btn {\n  border: 2px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  overflow: hidden;\n  padding: 0;\n  height: 82px;\n  background-color: #101010;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n\n.thumb-btn img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n}\n\n.thumb-btn.active,\n.thumb-btn:hover {\n  border-color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n.details-info h1 {\n  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.details-status {\n  display: inline-block;\n  background-color: var(--gold-soft);\n  color: var(--gold);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.45);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-pill);\n  padding: 4px 12px;\n  font-size: 0.78rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.details-price {\n  font-size: 1.8rem;\n  font-weight: 800;\n  color: var(--gold);\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.specs-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.specs-list li {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  padding: 11px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n}\n\n.specs-list span {\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.specs-list strong {\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n}\n\n.details-actions {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.details-actions .btn {\n  width: 100%;\n  padding: 14px 20px;\n  font-size: 0.95rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n}\n\n.details-description-box {\n  margin-top: 28px;\n  padding-top: 22px;\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n}\n\n.details-description-box h2 {\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.details-description-box p {\n  color: var(--text-secondary);\n  font-size: 0.98rem;\n}\n\n/* Monthly Installment Estimator (Logic & Calculation category) */\n.estimator-box {\n  margin-top: 24px;\n  padding: 20px;\n  background-color: var(--bg-input);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--gold);\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n}\n\n.estimator-box h3 {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n.estimator-controls {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 12px;\n  align-items: end;\n}\n\n.estimator-result {\n  background-color: var(--bg-surface);\n  color: var(--pure-white);\n  border: 1px solid var(--border-grey);\n  padding: 12px 14px;\n  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\n.estimator-result span {\n  display: block;\n  font-size: 0.76rem;\n  color: var(--text-muted);\n}\n\n.estimator-result strong {\n  font-size: 1.15rem;\n  color: var(--gold);\n}\n\n/* ---------- Responsive Media Queries ---------- */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  .section-header-split {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .section-header-aside {\n    text-align: left;\n    max-width: none;\n  }\n\n  .explore-layout {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .mobile-filter-toggle {\n    display: inline-flex;\n  }\n\n  .filters-sidebar {\n    display: none;\n  }\n\n  .filters-sidebar.open {\n    display: block;\n  }\n\n  .details-split {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .brands-strip {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 640px) {\n  .hero-banner-img {\n    height: 220px;\n  }\n\n  /* Match Mobile Prototype: compact hero -> Explore Cars -> Featured Cars stacked */\n  .hero-stats-row {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    gap: 10px;\n  }\n\n  .featured-grid,\n  .explore-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .search-sort-bar {\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: stretch;\n  }\n\n  .sort-select {\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .gallery-main {\n    height: 230px;\n  }\n\n  .thumb-btn {\n    height: 64px;\n  }\n\n  .estimator-controls {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n\n  .brands-strip {\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  }\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"C:\\Users\\User\\OneDrive\\Desktop\\CarVault project\\css\\pages.css"}}]}
